WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
An 8-minute video becomes 224 sampled observations.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The question defines what evidence matters.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Question-conditioned Optimal Transport couples 224
observations to 28 compact supports.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.500
The global Optimal Transport path models broad
whole-frame correspondence.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.000
The medium Optimal Transport path resolves coarse
three-by-three regional correspondence.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.500
The local Optimal Transport path resolves fine
actor-and-object correspondence.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Global, medium, and local Optimal Transport paths
construct the same feature support.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Support 24 traces back to real evidence at 335.73
seconds.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The language model decodes the question and 28 supports:
installing wooden boards.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.000
AVIOT: compact, traceable video evidence.
